  id: 
  playerChoiceText: 'Tell me more about what you are doing .. '
  lines:
  - speaker: Nomsa
    text: We are organizing a massive protest and vigil today. This is crucial for
      morale.
  - speaker: Player
    text: ' Sounds helpful. Who can join?'
  - speaker: Nomsa
    text: "Anyone. maybe you want to lead the organization? It\u2019s exhausting
      emotionally and logistically\r\n"
  - speaker: Player
    text: "Leading\u2026 that\u2019s a lot of responsibility.\r\n"
  - speaker: Nomsa
    text: "You\u2019ll lose a day of income, but your stress will drop significantly.Your
      community needs someone brave enough to act\r\n"
  - speaker: Player
    text: "This could break me emotionally\u2026 or heal me\r\n"
  - speaker: Nomsa
    text: 'Will you take this task?

'
  unlockTask: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d2d3b96dc83828c49bc642ef44603eab, type: 2}
